"<hr />  <p><em><b>Additional hint for power users:</b> This KDEPrint GUI "
"element matches  with the CUPS commandline job option parameter:</em>  "
"<pre>     -o prettyprint=true.  <br />     -o prettyprint=false  </pre> </"
"p>  </qt>"
